6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,288
That brings
€9,033 into the budget!

7
00:00:15,628 --> 00:00:18,112
Joe asked for
a plane as a house…

8
00:00:18,112 --> 00:00:19,750
Cleared for landing!

9
00:00:20,090 --> 00:00:22,545
Iknowlightyagamiiskira asked for
a big house…

10
00:00:22,545 --> 00:00:23,719
Here it is!

11
00:00:24,059 --> 00:00:28,922
Not14redmi, Tanja and 5 more
move into the apartment block!

12
00:00:28,922 --> 00:00:32,130
