€120,000.

24
00:00:59,496 --> 00:01:02,077
Ecaterina's sister
is waiting for it!

25
00:01:02,077 --> 00:01:04,555
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

26
00:01:04,895 --> 00:01:06,555
Who should lead
Leoville?

27
00:01:06,555 --> 00:01:08,336
Vote in the
comments!
